<title>NETHERLANDS: ABN AMRO sees higher EPS from SFB buy.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO sees higher EPS from SFB buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch bank ABN AMRO NV said on Friday the purchase of Standard Federal Bank would contribute several tens of guilder cents to earnings per share.  </p>
<p>&quot;On the basis of the expected 1997 profit of Standard Federal Bankcorp, the takeover will, once realised, contribute several tens of guilder cents to ABN AMRO's earnings per share,&quot; ABN AMRO said.</p>
<p>ABN AMRO said it would continue to comfortably meet the capital adequacy requirements of the Dutch central bank once the takeover had been consolidated.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
